{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"edits\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他已经离开那段熟悉的生活，起初还觉得这回总算不用再一再委屈自己了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"每当这份留恋冒出来，他就赶紧提醒自己当初受过的难堪，怕一心软又忘了为什么要走。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他想起从前和人在一起时那种自在，心里竟有一阵很轻的欢喜。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-4\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他忍不住想，自己一遍遍说当初走得对，是不是也有点说给自己听的意思。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"那股不服气渐渐淡了，他也不再急着替自己辩解，只是安静地难过。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"那阵难过慢慢缓下来，他终于能安静地想想从前和人在一起时那种不用时时防备的日子。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"离开以后，遇上难受的事，他常常只能自己熬过去；这时才知道，从前有人在身边，心里会轻松多少。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"不过，那样的日子毕竟真真切切地过过；想到这里，他心里也暖了一点。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"可一想到以后遇上难受的事都得自己熬，他忽然慌起来，刚才那点安稳一下子靠不住了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他没顾上想那些事，只觉得胸口忽然松了一下，像总算能喘口气。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"可这口气还没让他缓过来，刚有的一点安静就又退开了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"旧日生活刚才还像在眼前，转眼又远了；他又想起那个问题：如果早知道离开以后会这么孤单，当初还会走吗？\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里一沉，连再往下想的力气都没有了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"可他还是会想起从前那些好，连“走得对”这几个字都说不痛快。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"想来想去，他还是答不出当初该不该走，只觉得不能再把往后的日子都耗在这个问题上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他终于能这样想了：当初受的委屈确实不该忍，可从前那些开心的日子，也不能因为离开就一笔勾销。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"这回再想起过去，他还是会心软，但不再觉得一想念就非得回去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"想起从前和人在一起时那种自然亲近的日子，他心里又软又热，也想把眼下的日子过好，盼着有一天还能再有那份亲近。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"这股热切过去，他又想到往后仍会有孤单的时候，也不知道什么时候才能再有那样的亲近，心里慢慢安静下来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"可有一点他终于拿定了：哪怕以后还想回去，也不能再委屈自己去换那份亲近。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"note\": \"删减了重复的自我辩护和中段反复回绕，让S06的失去依靠、S07的孤单疑问、S10的思考疲惫逐步推动S11的转向；同时压缩段内同义表达，把关键心理变化改成更平常、具体的说法，并让S08真正成为短暂喘息。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e4a117b7-08dd-425b-a303-3c071d9fb4f9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261103T071206659350Z", "elapsed_seconds": 221.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-03T07:15:48.068645+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4990b13cfbd6d371610c9497dd91ced029d386ac753739f319e588a03fcadfed", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261103T071206659350Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "375dcf85a50bad8bccbeba1ceded7ec42cca125d5553222d20098c8ed23629be"}}}
